{"schema":1,"revision":93514486,"page":{"pageid":940806,"title":"饮食文化","displayTitle":"飲食文化","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173184\">.mw-parser-output .ambox{border:1px solid #a2a9b1;border-left:10px solid #36c;background-color:#fbfbfb;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox,.mw-parser-output .ambox+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.mw-empty-elt+.ambox{margin-top:-1px}html body.mediawiki .mw-parser-output .ambox.mbox-small-left{margin:4px 1em 4px 0;overflow:hidden;width:238px;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:88%;line-height:1.25em}.mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{border-left:10px solid #b32424;background-color:#fee7e6}.mw-parser-output .ambox-delete{border-left:10px solid #b32424}.mw-parser-output .ambox-content{border-left:10px solid #f28500}.mw-parser-output .ambox-style{border-left:10px solid #fc3}.mw-parser-output .ambox-move{border-left:10px solid #9932cc}.mw-parser-output .ambox-protection{border-left:10px solid #a2a9b1}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.5em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox .mbox-image-div{width:52px}@media(min-width:720px){.mw-parser-output .ambox{margin:0 10%}}@media screen{html.skin-theme-clientpref-night .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media screen and (prefers-color-scheme:dark){html.skin-theme-clientpref-os .mw-parser-output .ambox-speedy{background-color:#300!important}}@media print{body.ns-0 .mw-parser-output .ambox{display:none!important}}</style><table class=\"box-Refimprove plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-content\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Tango-nosources.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/60px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"45\" height=\"45\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4e/Tango-nosources.svg/120px-Tango-nosources.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>需要補充更多<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%88%97%E6%98%8E%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:列明來源\">來源</a></b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <small class=\"date-container\"><i>(<span class=\"date\">2021年4月24日</span>)</i></small><span class=\"hide-when-compact\"><br /><small>請協助補充多方面<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">可靠來源</a>以<a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"//zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96&amp;action=edit\" href=\"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96&amp;action=edit\">改善這篇條目</a>，<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E4%BE%9B%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%81\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikipedia:可供查證\">無法查證</a>的內容可能會因為<a href=\"/wiki/Template:Fact\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Template:Fact\">異議提出</a>而被移除。<br />致使用者：請搜尋一下條目的標題（來源搜尋：<span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?&amp;as_eq=wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">\"飲食文化\"</a> &#8212; <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">網頁</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=nws&amp;q=&amp;as_src=-newswire+-wire+-presswire+-PR+-press+-release+-wikipedia&amp;q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">新聞</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//books.google.com/books?&amp;as_brr=0&amp;as_pub=-icon&amp;q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">書籍</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//scholar.google.com/scholar?&amp;q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">學術</a>、<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.google.com/search?tbm=isch&amp;safe=off&amp;q=%22%E9%A5%AE%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96%22\">圖像</a></span>），以檢查網路上是否存在該主題的更多可靠來源（<a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%8F%AF%E9%9D%A0%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90\" title=\"Wikipedia:可靠來源\">判定指引</a>）。</small></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r95173184\" /><table class=\"box-Expand&#95;language plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-notice\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div class=\"mbox-image-div\"><span class=\"skin-invert\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/60px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"17\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/da/Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg/120px-Translation_to_zh_arrow.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"20\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">此條目<b>可參照<a href=\"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%9F%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"ja:食文化\">日語維基百科</a>相應條目來擴充</b>。<span class=\"hide-when-compact\"></span> <sma